ccf-review finding 4b3fffc432b7 (CORE-ERR-001, must-fix, accepted): a forward whose response body is cut after the headers made httputil.ReverseProxy panic with http.ErrAbortHandler past g.finish, so the request left no egress record. Fix: plain defers finish; forwardPlain fills Status/Up/Down in its own defer, so every exit (the abort included) writes one record. The CONNECT path has no such panic source (hijacked conns, io.Copy, every error returns), so it is unchanged. Test: TestForwardCutResponse (upstream Content-Length: 100, 7 bytes, close -> exactly one forward record, up 6 down 7); without the fix it fails with zero records.
